{
  "title": "Analytic: Bragg mirror spectrum and standing wave (harmonic FDTD)",
  "description": "Four quarter-wave layers (n_H = 2, d_H = 150 nm, vacuum spacers d_L = 300 nm, period 450 nm, Bragg wavelength lambda_B = 4 n_H d_H = 1.2 um) in a y-periodic vacuum strip. em_fdtd_ez in a frequency_domain study (harmonic FDTD): one gaussian pulse from a one-sided mode source (the plane wave of the periodic strip, 1 W/m toward +x) gives the mode-monitor spectra and the complex E_z of 31 study wavelengths 0.95-1.7 um.\nAnalytic (transfer matrix of N = 4 cells): T_N = 1 / (1 + F sin^2(delta_H) U_3(xi)^2), F = ((n_H^2 - 1)/(2 n_H))^2, delta_H = 2 pi n_H d_H / lambda, delta_L = 2 pi d_L / lambda, xi = cos(K a) = cos(delta_H) cos(delta_L) - (n_H + 1/n_H)/2 sin(delta_H) sin(delta_L), U_3(xi) = 8 xi^3 - 4 xi (valid inside and outside the stop band); R = 1 - T (lossless). T(lambda_B) = 0.0155.\nSpectra tab: em.trans quantity fraction_positive (transmission) and em.refl (upstream of the source) quantity fraction_negative (reflection) vs the dashed T_N and 1 - T_N.\nLine profile tab (snapshot 10 = lambda_B): |E_z| upstream of the source = E_inc sqrt(R), between source and stack the standing wave between the dashed envelopes E_inc (1 +- sqrt(R)), behind the stack E_inc sqrt(T), E_inc = sqrt(2 eta0 P / Ly) = 8.68e4 V/m.\nDerived values tab: T_mid, R_mid at lambda_B and E_behind = mean |E_z| behind the stack at the last study wavelength (1.7 um, the live state) vs E_inc sqrt(T_N(1.7 um)).\nExpected agreement: < 1 % (numerical dispersion shifts the band edges slightly; the mode source launch is exact at lambda_B only; truncated ring-down at auto_shutoff 1e-6).",
  "version": 1,
  "parameters": [
    {"name": "n_H", "expression": 2.0, "description": "index of the high-index layers"},
    {"name": "d_H", "expression": "150*nm", "description": "high-index layer thickness (quarter wave at lambda_B)"},
    {"name": "d_L", "expression": "300*nm", "description": "vacuum spacer thickness (quarter wave at lambda_B)"},
    {"name": "a_per", "expression": "d_H + d_L", "description": "stack period"},
    {"name": "x_stack", "expression": "1.0*um", "description": "front face of the first layer"},
    {"name": "Lx", "expression": "4*um", "description": "domain length (cpml on both x faces)"},
    {"name": "Ly", "expression": "0.1*um", "description": "periodic y period (20 cells)"},
    {"name": "dx_cell", "expression": "5*nm", "description": "uniform cell size (layer faces on cell edges)"},
    {"name": "x_refl", "expression": "0.2525*um", "description": "reflection mode monitor (cell centre, upstream of the source)"},
    {"name": "x_src", "expression": "0.5025*um", "description": "mode source line (cell centre)"},
    {"name": "x_trans", "expression": "3.0025*um", "description": "transmission mode monitor (cell centre, behind the stack)"},
    {"name": "y_line", "expression": "Ly/2 + dx_cell/2", "description": "y of the line profiles (a cell centre)"},
    {"name": "lambda_B", "expression": "4*n_H*d_H", "description": "Bragg wavelength (1.2 um) = source centre = study wavelength 10"},
    {"name": "lambda_end", "expression": "1.7*um", "description": "last study wavelength (live state after the run)"},
    {"name": "P_src", "expression": 1.0, "description": "mode source power [W/m]"},
    {"name": "E_inc", "expression": "sqrt(2*mu0_const*c_const*P_src/Ly)", "description": "incident plane-wave |E_z| [V/m]"},
    {"name": "F_c", "expression": "((n_H**2 - 1)/(2*n_H))**2", "description": "coefficient of finesse of one layer"},
    {"name": "rho_H", "expression": "(n_H + 1/n_H)/2", "description": "(n_H + 1/n_H)/2"},
    {"name": "dH_B", "expression": "2*pi*n_H*d_H/lambda_B", "description": "layer phase at lambda_B (pi/2)"},
    {"name": "dL_B", "expression": "2*pi*d_L/lambda_B", "description": "spacer phase at lambda_B (pi/2)"},
    {"name": "xi_B", "expression": "cos(dH_B)*cos(dL_B) - rho_H*sin(dH_B)*sin(dL_B)", "description": "cos(K a) at lambda_B (-1.25)"},
    {"name": "T_B", "expression": "1/(1 + F_c*sin(dH_B)**2*(8*xi_B**3 - 4*xi_B)**2)", "description": "T_N at lambda_B"},
    {"name": "R_B", "expression": "1 - T_B", "description": "R_N at lambda_B"},
    {"name": "dH_e", "expression": "2*pi*n_H*d_H/lambda_end", "description": "layer phase at lambda_end"},
    {"name": "dL_e", "expression": "2*pi*d_L/lambda_end", "description": "spacer phase at lambda_end"},
    {"name": "xi_e", "expression": "cos(dH_e)*cos(dL_e) - rho_H*sin(dH_e)*sin(dL_e)", "description": "cos(K a) at lambda_end"},
    {"name": "T_end", "expression": "1/(1 + F_c*sin(dH_e)**2*(8*xi_e**3 - 4*xi_e)**2)", "description": "T_N at lambda_end"}
  ],
  "domain": {"size_x": "Lx", "size_y": "Ly"},
  "geometry": [
    {"name": "layer_1", "kind": "rectangle", "params": {"x0": "x_stack", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_stack + d_H", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "layer_2", "kind": "rectangle",
     "params": {"x0": "x_stack + a_per", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_stack + a_per + d_H", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "layer_3", "kind": "rectangle",
     "params": {"x0": "x_stack + 2*a_per", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_stack + 2*a_per + d_H", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "layer_4", "kind": "rectangle",
     "params": {"x0": "x_stack + 3*a_per", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_stack + 3*a_per + d_H", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "behind", "kind": "rectangle", "params": {"x0": "2.6*um", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "3.9*um", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "refl_line", "kind": "line", "params": {"x0": "x_refl", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_refl", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "source_line", "kind": "line", "params": {"x0": "x_src", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_src", "y1": "Ly"}},
    {"name": "trans_line", "kind": "line", "params": {"x0": "x_trans", "y0": 0.0, "x1": "x_trans", "y1": "Ly"}}
  ],
  "selections": [],
  "materials": [
    {"name": "high_index", "library": null, "properties": {"eps_r": "n_H**2"}, "dispersion": null,
     "selection": ["layer_1", "layer_2", "layer_3", "layer_4"]}
  ],
  "physics": [
    {
      "name": "em",
      "type": "em_fdtd_ez",
      "settings": {"bc_y_lo": "periodic", "bc_y_hi": "periodic"},
      "features": [
        {"name": "source", "type": "mode_source", "selection": ["source_line"],
         "params": {"mode_number": 1, "direction": "positive", "waveform": "gaussian", "wavelength": "lambda_B",
                    "bandwidth": 0.3, "power": "P_src"},
         "enabled": true},
        {"name": "refl", "type": "mode_monitor", "selection": ["refl_line"],
         "params": {"mode_number": 1, "wavelength_start": "0.95*um", "wavelength_stop": "1.7*um",
                    "n_wavelengths": 151},
         "enabled": true},
        {"name": "trans", "type": "mode_monitor", "selection": ["trans_line"],
         "params": {"mode_number": 1, "wavelength_start": "0.95*um", "wavelength_stop": "1.7*um",
                    "n_wavelengths": 151},
         "enabled": true}
      ],
      "every": 1
    }
  ],
  "couplings": [],
  "mesh": {"mode": "uniform", "dx": "dx_cell", "max_ratio": 1.15, "wavelength_min": null,
           "points_per_wavelength": 20.0, "refinements": []},
  "study": {"type": "frequency_domain",
            "settings": {"wavelength_start": "0.95*um", "wavelength_stop": "lambda_end", "n_wavelengths": 31,
                         "auto_shutoff": 1e-6, "max_duration": "2*ps"},
            "stored_fields": ["em.ez_abs"], "sweep": null},
  "derived_values": [
    {"name": "T_mid", "expression": "fraction_positive", "selection": [], "operation": "at", "source": "em.trans",
     "at": "lambda_B", "reference": "T_B", "tolerance": 0.08},
    {"name": "R_mid", "expression": "fraction_negative", "selection": [], "operation": "at", "source": "em.refl",
     "at": "lambda_B", "reference": "R_B", "tolerance": 0.03},
    {"name": "E_behind", "expression": "ez_abs", "selection": ["behind"], "operation": "mean",
     "reference": "E_inc*sqrt(T_end)", "tolerance": 0.01}
  ],
  "analytic_curves": [
    {"name": "T_stack", "target": "em.trans", "series": "fraction_positive",
     "expression": "1/(1 + F_c*sin(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)**2*(8*(cos(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*cos(2*pi*d_L/wavelength) - rho_H*sin(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*sin(2*pi*d_L/wavelength))**3 - 4*(cos(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*cos(2*pi*d_L/wavelength) - rho_H*sin(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*sin(2*pi*d_L/wavelength)))**2)",
     "tolerance": 0.02},
    {"name": "R_stack", "target": "em.refl", "series": "fraction_negative",
     "expression": "1 - 1/(1 + F_c*sin(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)**2*(8*(cos(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*cos(2*pi*d_L/wavelength) - rho_H*sin(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*sin(2*pi*d_L/wavelength))**3 - 4*(cos(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*cos(2*pi*d_L/wavelength) - rho_H*sin(2*pi*n_H*d_H/wavelength)*sin(2*pi*d_L/wavelength)))**2)",
     "tolerance": 0.02},
    {"name": "upstream_sqrt_R", "target": "line", "expression": "E_inc*sqrt(R_B)", "tolerance": 0.01,
     "line": ["0.05*um", "y_line", "0.45*um", "y_line"], "field": "em.ez_abs", "snapshot": 10},
    {"name": "standing_wave_max", "target": "line", "expression": "E_inc*(1 + sqrt(R_B))",
     "line": ["0.55*um", "y_line", "0.995*um", "y_line"], "field": "em.ez_abs", "snapshot": 10},
    {"name": "standing_wave_min", "target": "line", "expression": "E_inc*(1 - sqrt(R_B))",
     "line": ["0.55*um", "y_line", "0.995*um", "y_line"], "field": "em.ez_abs", "snapshot": 10},
    {"name": "behind_sqrt_T", "target": "line", "expression": "E_inc*sqrt(T_B)", "tolerance": 0.01,
     "line": ["2.55*um", "y_line", "3.95*um", "y_line"], "field": "em.ez_abs", "snapshot": 10}
  ]
}
